<title>UK: B.A.T gains on U.S. court tobacco ruling.</title>
<headline>B.A.T gains on U.S. court tobacco ruling.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in B.A.T. Industries Plc gained strongly on Tuesday after news the U.S. Supreme Court had let stand the dismissal of a lawsuit against two tobacco firms and two industry groups.</p>
<p>B.A.T shares, which had languished near the day's low of 448p prior to the news, touched a high of 460p before edging back to trade at 453-1/2p by 1414 GMT, up four pence on the day.</p>
</text>
